reims-manager (1.0.2-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Safely unmount mounted USB drive volumes before handing the device to QEMU.
  * Explain busy-volume and permission errors with clear recovery guidance.
  * Recover an interrupted temporary usbmuxd stop after confirming QEMU has no
    manager-owned USB device attached.

